{"seq":2,"slug":"morphogens-positional-information","title":"形态发生素与位置信息","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/developmental-biology/patterning-mechanisms/morphogens-positional-information","wordCount":1350,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"形态发生素与位置信息\">形态发生素与位置信息</h1><p>1969 年，刘易斯·沃尔珀特问了一个看似简单的问题：一排细胞如何知道自己排在第几位？他给出的答案——「法国国旗模型」——成为发育生物学最有影响力的理论之一。设想一排细胞沿着一条线排列，一端有信号源，信号分子向另一端扩散，浓度由高到低形成梯度。每个细胞测量自己处的浓度，越过某个阈值就变蓝，越过另一个就变白，否则变红——一条连续的浓度梯度，就这样被翻译成蓝白红三色的离散图案。本篇讲清这个分子如何成为坐标、细胞如何读出位置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-从浓度梯度到离散命运\">核心概念：从浓度梯度到离散命运</h2><p>形态发生素（morphogen）是一种以浓度依赖方式诱导不同命运的扩散性信号分子。它的运作可拆成三步：建立梯度、设定阈值、解读位置。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[信号源&lt;br/&gt;局部分泌] --&gt; B[扩散 + 降解&lt;br/&gt;形成浓度梯度]&#10;  B --&gt; C{细胞测量&lt;br/&gt;本地浓度}&#10;  C --&gt;|高于阈值2| D[命运 A]&#10;  C --&gt;|阈值1到2之间| E[命运 B]&#10;  C --&gt;|低于阈值1| F[命运 C]&#10;  D --&gt; G[离散的空间图案]&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  F --&gt; G\">flowchart TD\n  A[信号源&lt;br/&gt;局部分泌] --&gt; B[扩散 + 降解&lt;br/&gt;形成浓度梯度]\n  B --&gt; C{细胞测量&lt;br/&gt;本地浓度}\n  C --&gt;|高于阈值2| D[命运 A]\n  C --&gt;|阈值1到2之间| E[命运 B]\n  C --&gt;|低于阈值1| F[命运 C]\n  D --&gt; G[离散的空间图案]\n  E --&gt; G\n  F --&gt; G</pre><p>这一框架把「位置信息」量化了：细胞的命运是其所处浓度的函数，而浓度又是其到信号源距离的函数。于是空间位置被编码为一个可被读取的化学量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"梯度如何形成-反应-扩散的数学\">梯度如何形成：反应-扩散的数学</h2><p>最简单的梯度由「源处合成、扩散传播、各处降解」三者平衡而成。设形态发生素浓度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C(x,t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，扩散系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>，一阶降解速率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>，则其动力学满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>D</mi><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\partial C}{\\partial t} = D\\frac{\\partial^2 C}{\\partial x^2} - kC</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1771em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>在源处恒定供给的稳态下（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\partial C/\\partial t = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>），解为指数衰减：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>λ</mi></mrow></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C(x) = C_0\\, e^{-x/\\lambda}, \\qquad \\lambda = \\sqrt{D/k}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1324em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">λ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.24em;vertical-align:-0.2561em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9839em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.9439em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.28em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.28em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1296\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M263,681c0.7,0,18,39.7,52,119\nc34,79.3,68.167,158.7,102.5,238c34.3,79.3,51.8,119.3,52.5,120\nc340,-704.7,510.7,-1060.3,512,-1067\nl0 -0\nc4.7,-7.3,11,-11,19,-11\nH40000v40H1012.3\ns-271.3,567,-271.3,567c-38.7,80.7,-84,175,-136,283c-52,108,-89.167,185.3,-111.5,232\nc-22.3,46.7,-33.8,70.3,-34.5,71c-4.7,4.7,-12.3,7,-23,7s-12,-1,-12,-1\ns-109,-253,-109,-253c-72.7,-168,-109.3,-252,-110,-252c-10.7,8,-22,16.7,-34,26\nc-22,17.3,-33.3,26,-34,26s-26,-26,-26,-26s76,-59,76,-59s76,-60,76,-60z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2561em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 是特征长度，决定梯度的「陡峭程度」。这个简洁结果有深刻含义：梯度的空间尺度由扩散与降解的比值决定，调节降解速率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 就能改变图案的范围——这正是胚胎在不同大小下维持比例（scaling）的潜在手段之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"经典案例-bicoid-与-sonic-hedgehog\">经典案例：Bicoid 与 Sonic Hedgehog</h2><p>理论需要实例支撑。两个被研究得最透彻的形态发生素分别来自果蝇和脊椎动物：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>形态发生素</th>\n<th>系统</th>\n<th>梯度方向</th>\n<th>解读结果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Bicoid</td>\n<td>果蝇前后轴</td>\n<td>前端高、后端低</td>\n<td>激活不同缺口基因，划分体节区</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sonic Hedgehog (Shh)</td>\n<td>脊椎动物神经管</td>\n<td>腹侧（脊索/底板）高</td>\n<td>指定不同腹侧神经元亚型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BMP/Dpp</td>\n<td>背腹轴</td>\n<td>与 Shh 相对</td>\n<td>指定背侧命运</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>视黄酸</td>\n<td>前后轴、肢芽</td>\n<td>后端/近端高</td>\n<td>设定近远端与前后身份</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Bicoid 是历史上第一个被分子证实的形态发生素，它沿果蝇前后轴形成指数梯度（详见 <a href=\"axis-formation-body-plan\">体轴形成与身体蓝图</a>），不同浓度阈值激活不同的下游缺口基因。Sonic Hedgehog 则在脊椎动物神经管腹侧由脊索和底板分泌，浓度自腹向背递减，依次指定运动神经元等不同神经元亚型——这一过程是 <a href=\"../organogenesis/neural-development\">神经发育</a> 中神经管背腹模式化的核心。</p>\n<h2 id=\"细胞如何精确读取-噪声与鲁棒性\">细胞如何精确读取：噪声与鲁棒性</h2><p>一个长期困扰理论的问题是：分子浓度天然带噪声，扩散是随机过程，细胞凭什么能把边界划得如此精确？真实胚胎用多种策略压低误差：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>时间平均</strong>：细胞在一段时间内多次测量取平均，降低瞬时涨落的影响。</li>\n<li><strong>空间平均</strong>：相邻细胞通过缝隙连接交流读数，抹平局部噪声。</li>\n<li><strong>基因调控网络锐化</strong>：下游基因间的互相抑制把模糊的浓度边界转化为锐利的开关式表达，这类细胞内的逻辑由信号通路落实，详见 <a href=\"cell-fate-signaling\">细胞命运决定与信号通路</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>整合多个梯度</strong>：同时读取两个相对的梯度（如 Shh 与 BMP），交叉验证比单一梯度更鲁棒。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些机制共同把一个本应误差很大的「读尺」过程，提升到能可靠划出单细胞精度边界的水平。</p>\n<h2 id=\"超越纯扩散-图灵与组织尺度\">超越纯扩散：图灵与组织尺度</h2><p>并非所有图案都需要预设的信号源。1952 年图灵提出，仅靠一个慢扩散的激活剂与一个快扩散的抑制剂相互作用，就能从均匀初态自发涌现出周期性图案（斑点、条纹）。这种反应-扩散机制被认为参与了毛囊间距、指（趾）数目等周期结构的形成，是形态发生素思想的重要补充——位置信息可以是「读取预设梯度」，也可以是「自组织涌现」。两类机制在 <a href=\"../organogenesis/organogenesis-overview\">器官发生概览</a> 的分支与重复结构中都有体现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>形态发生素以浓度依赖方式诱导命运，把连续梯度翻译成离散图案（法国国旗模型）。</li>\n<li>源-扩散-降解的稳态给出指数梯度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>λ</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C(x)=C_0 e^{-x/\\lambda}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.038em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">λ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，特征长度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda=\\sqrt{D/k}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.24em;vertical-align:-0.305em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.935em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.895em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.28em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.28em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1296\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M263,681c0.7,0,18,39.7,52,119\nc34,79.3,68.167,158.7,102.5,238c34.3,79.3,51.8,119.3,52.5,120\nc340,-704.7,510.7,-1060.3,512,-1067\nl0 -0\nc4.7,-7.3,11,-11,19,-11\nH40000v40H1012.3\ns-271.3,567,-271.3,567c-38.7,80.7,-84,175,-136,283c-52,108,-89.167,185.3,-111.5,232\nc-22.3,46.7,-33.8,70.3,-34.5,71c-4.7,4.7,-12.3,7,-23,7s-12,-1,-12,-1\ns-109,-253,-109,-253c-72.7,-168,-109.3,-252,-110,-252c-10.7,8,-22,16.7,-34,26\nc-22,17.3,-33.3,26,-34,26s-26,-26,-26,-26s76,-59,76,-59s76,-60,76,-60z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.305em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 决定尺度。</li>\n<li>Bicoid（果蝇前后轴）与 Sonic Hedgehog（神经管腹背轴）是两个最经典的实例。</li>\n<li>时间/空间平均、基因网络锐化与多梯度整合，使细胞能在噪声中精确读出位置。</li>\n<li>图灵的反应-扩散机制提供了无需预设信号源、自发涌现周期图案的补充路径。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"形态发生素与位置信息","id":"形态发生素与位置信息"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从浓度梯度到离散命运","id":"核心概念-从浓度梯度到离散命运"},{"level":2,"text":"梯度如何形成：反应-扩散的数学","id":"梯度如何形成-反应-扩散的数学"},{"level":2,"text":"经典案例：Bicoid 与 Sonic Hedgehog","id":"经典案例-bicoid-与-sonic-hedgehog"},{"level":2,"text":"细胞如何精确读取：噪声与鲁棒性","id":"细胞如何精确读取-噪声与鲁棒性"},{"level":2,"text":"超越纯扩散：图灵与组织尺度","id":"超越纯扩散-图灵与组织尺度"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"体轴形成与身体蓝图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/developmental-biology/patterning-mechanisms/axis-formation-body-plan"},"next":{"title":"细胞命运决定与信号通路","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/developmental-biology/patterning-mechanisms/cell-fate-signaling"}}